Package: extractmeteobr
Title: Extract Area-Weighted Municipal Meteorological Time Series for Brazil
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("LHMET", email = "lhmet@ufsm.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts gridded BR-DWGD meteorological NetCDF rasters into
    area-weighted time series for Brazilian municipalities and states.
    Provides functions to load IBGE administrative boundaries, crop and
    aggregate BR-DWGD rasters, interpolate missing raster cells, calculate
    exact polygon-cell area-weighted means, and write the resulting
    municipal time series to disk.
